# Gate "lookout": the barred village gate (DESIGN.md D.9). The door block (cols 56-57, rows 15-18) rises 4 rows into
# the wall while the latch plate on the gallery is pressed - and a latch stays pressed. The tablet stands at
# the hop spot under the gallery's end; the far cell lies beyond the gate.
